  "details": "**VRChat Version:** 1277\n\n**Description of the bug:** Audio latency for voice chat is too high. Udon network updates are slightly faster than IK, and IK is about 500-1000ms faster than audio latency. With a user in Discord, we can notice that Discord is about 500-1000 ms faster than VRChat on average for voice audio. \n\n**Steps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):** Use voice chat in game, especially on servers from another contient (US to EU for example).",
